<p>Hey <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone requested a link to change your password. Tap the button below to set a new one.</p>

<p><%= link_to 'Change my password', edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), class: 'ck-email-btn', style: 'display: inline-block; background: #FF6B6B; border: 3px solid #000; color: #000 !important; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; margin: 8px 0;' %></p>

<p>If you didn't request this, ignore this email — your password won't change until you use the link above.</p>